
<view class="page">
 <view class="topbar"><view class="brand" bindtap="home">布偶瞄了个喵</view><button class="sound" bindtap="toggleSound">{{sound?'♫ 开':'♫ 关'}}</button></view>
 <block wx:if="{{screen==='home'}}">
  <view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE PAUSE, A LITTLE PURR</view>
  <view class="hero-title"><view>把烦恼消掉，</view><view>把可爱留下。</view></view>
  <view class="hero-caption">陪小宝玩一局，今天也要软乎乎。</view>
  <view class="cat-scene"><view class="orbit orbit-one"></view><view class="orbit orbit-two"></view><text class="scene-leaf">✦</text><image class="scene-ball-photo" src="/assets/cards/08.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><image class="cat-photo" src="/assets/cards/00.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="name-tag">小宝 · 今日份陪伴已就位</view></view>
  <view class="home-actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="startFirst">开始陪小宝玩 <text>↗</text></button><button wx:if="{{hasSave}}" class="secondary" bindtap="resumeSave">继续上次的牌局</button></view>
  <view class="entry-grid"><view bindtap="showLevels"><text class="entry-icon">▦</text><text>关卡小路</text><text class="entry-hint">入门 · 极限 · 千张挑战</text></view><view bindtap="showAlbum"><text class="entry-icon">✿</text><text>卡牌图鉴</text><text class="entry-hint">{{albumCount}} / 24 已解锁</text></view><view bindtap="showGuide"><text class="entry-icon">?</text><text>新手指南</text><text class="entry-hint">一眼就会的小规则</text></view></view>
  <view class="footer-note">不赶时间，慢慢消。<text>MADE FOR YOUR SOFT MOMENTS</text></view>
 </block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen==='levels'}}"><view class="section-eyebrow">THREE LITTLE ADVENTURES</view><view class="section-title">小宝的关卡小路</view><view class="subtext">第一关9张明牌，第二关216张，第三关1000张。</view><view class="levels"><view wx:for="{{levelItems}}" wx:key="index" class="level-card {{item.locked?'locked':''}}" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="chooseLevel"><view class="level-no">{{item.locked?'🔒':item.number}}</view><view class="level-info"><view>{{item.name}}</view><text>{{item.count}} 张卡牌 · {{item.kinds}} 种图案</text></view><text class="level-stars">{{item.cleared?(item.stars===3?'★★★':item.stars===2?'★★☆':'★☆☆'):'→'}}</text></view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="home">回到小窝</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen==='album'}}"><view class="section-eyebrow">XIAOBAO'S LITTLE COLLECTION</view><view class="section-title">24 种小小欢喜</view><view class="subtext">已解锁 {{albumCount}} / 24 · 完成关卡，遇见新朋友</view><scroll-view scroll-x class="filters"><text class="filter {{themeFilter===-1?'selected':''}}" data-index="-1" bindtap="filterTheme">全部</text><text wx:for="{{themeNames}}" wx:key="*this" class="filter {{themeFilter===index?'selected':''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="filterTheme">{{item}}</text></scroll-view><view class="album-grid"><view wx:for="{{album}}" wx:key="id" class="album-card {{item.locked?'locked':''}}"><view class="album-symbol" style="background:{{item.color}}"><text wx:if="{{item.locked}}">待解锁</text><image wx:else src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFit" class="album-image"/></view><text>{{item.locked?'待解锁':item.name}}</text></view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="home">回到小窝</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen==='guide'}}"><view class="section-eyebrow">LET'S PLAY TOGETHER</view><view class="section-title">小宝的游戏说明</view><view class="guide-card"><view>01 · 找到能拿起的卡牌</view><text>只有未被上层卡牌遮挡的牌可以点击。灰色卡牌需要先移开上面的牌。</text><view>02 · 三张相同，就消除</view><text>收集槽有7个位置。完全相同的3张牌会自动消除；第7张若能凑齐三张，仍可正常消除。</text><view>03 · 留一点空间</view><text>槽位占满又没有凑齐三张，本局失败。清空场上、收集槽和寄存区才算通关。</text><view>04 · 道具来帮忙</view><text>撤回：每局一次，只能撤回最近一次未消除的操作。洗牌：每局一次，保留布局并校验可解性；寄存区非空时不可用。寄存：每局一次，把槽内最前面最多3张牌暂存，再点击取回。复活：每局一次，需要寄存区为空。</text><view>05 · 慢慢解锁</view><text>3关、24种图案。第三关为999张三消牌加1张金边奖励牌；奖励牌移开遮挡后可直接收集，不占槽位。第一关完成后解锁全部24张图鉴；不用道具获得三星，使用1～2次获得两星，其余获得一星。自动保存未完成牌局。提示音可关闭。</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="startFirst">明白啦，开始玩</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="home">回到小窝</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen==='game'}}">
  <view class="game-heading"><view><view class="section-eyebrow">LEVEL {{levelNumber < 10?'0':''}}{{levelNumber}}</view><view class="game-title">{{levelName}}</view></view><button class="pause" bindtap="pause">Ⅱ</button></view>
  <view class="stats"><text>剩余 <text class="stat-value">{{remaining}}</text> 张</text><text>已消除 <text class="stat-value">{{matched}}</text> 组</text><text>可选 <text class="stat-value">{{exposed}}</text> 张</text></view>
  <view class="board-wrap"><canvas id="board" type="2d" class="board" style="height:{{canvasHeight}}px" bindtouchend="onBoardTouch"></canvas><view class="board-note">{{artReady?'没有上层牌压住，就能点击；暗牌要先解开遮挡。':'正在加载小宝的图片卡牌…'}}</view></view>
  <view class="tray-heading"><text>小宝的收集篮</text><text>三张相同即可消除</text></view>
  <view class="tray"><view wx:for="{{traySlots}}" wx:key="key" class="tray-slot {{item.empty?'empty':''}}"><image wx:if="{{!item.empty}}" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFit" class="tray-image"/><text class="tray-label">{{item.empty?'·':item.name}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="game-message">{{message || '别着急，小宝陪你慢慢想。'}}</view>
  <view class="stash-area"><text>临时寄存</text><view class="stash-list"><view wx:for="{{stashCards}}" wx:key="index" class="stash-card" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="takeStash"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFit" class="stash-image"/><text>{{item.name}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{!stashCards.length}}" class="stash-empty">空空的，需要时再用</text></view></view>
  <view class="tools"><button class="{{!canUndo?'disabled':''}}" bindtap="useUndo"><text>↶</text>撤回 <text class="tool-count">{{tools.undo}}</text></button><button class="{{!tools.shuffle?'disabled':''}}" bindtap="useShuffle"><text>⤨</text>洗牌 <text class="tool-count">{{tools.shuffle}}</text></button><button class="{{!tools.stash?'disabled':''}}" bindtap="useStore"><text>▱</text>寄存 <text class="tool-count">{{tools.stash}}</text></button></view>
 </block>
 <view wx:if="{{modal}}" class="overlay" catchtouchmove="noop"><view class="modal">
  <block wx:if="{{modal==='won'}}"><view class="modal-emoji">🎉</view><view class="section-title">{{levelNumber===totalLevels?'小宝毕业啦！':'小宝为你鼓掌！'}}</view><view class="stars">{{stars===3?'★★★':stars===2?'★★☆':'★☆☆'}}</view><view class="subtext">{{levelNumber===totalLevels?'24种卡牌都解锁了，感谢你的陪伴。':'这一关的烦恼，已经全部消掉啦。'}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="nextLevel">{{levelNumber===totalLevels?'查看全部关卡':'走向下一关 →'}}</button><button open-type="share" class="secondary">分享这份小开心</button></block>
  <block wx:elif="{{modal==='lost'}}"><view class="modal-emoji">🐾</view><view class="section-title">小篮子装满啦</view><view class="subtext">没关系，小宝陪你再想想。<view></view>复活会把最前面3张牌放进寄存区。</view><button wx:if="{{tools.revive && !stashCards.length}}" class="primary" bindtap="revive">给小宝一次机会 · 免费复活</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="restart">重新挑战</button></block>
  <block wx:else><view class="modal-emoji">☁️</view><view class="section-title">休息一小会儿</view><view class="subtext">进度已保存，小宝在这里等你。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="continueGame">继续陪小宝玩</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="restart">重新挑战</button></block>
  <button class="text-button" bindtap="home">回到小窝</button>
 </view></view>
</view>
